{"title": "Tiny Trader Table", "pageid": 13606, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tiny_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Tiny Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Vendor_Tiny</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Vendor_Tiny+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Vendor_Tiny+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled Treasure Table containing a small amount of <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>. Similar drop tables include <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Trader_Table\" title=\"Poor Trader Table\">Poor Trader Table</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fancy_Trader_Table\" title=\"Fancy Trader Table\">Fancy Trader Table</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Tiny Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p><p><i>Rolls one or two times on the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tiny Trader Table</a>. Worth 5.0 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a> on average.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>3/5</td><td>2/5</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_2\" title=\"Food Supply Table 2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ee/FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/FOOD_Purple_Grapes_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_2\" title=\"Food Supply Table 2\">Food Supply Table 2</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_3\" title=\"Food Supply Table 3\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/FOOD_Apple_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></